03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"VA"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T18:51:40+00:00","id":"hr295-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-09","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-14","text":"Referred to the Subcommittee on General Farm Commodities, Risk Management, and Credit."},"laws":[],"number":"295","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Agriculture and Food","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"L000600","district":23,"fullName":"Rep. Langworthy, Nicholas A. [R-NY-23]","party":"R","state":"NY"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-09","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Fair Milk Pricing for Farmers Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires manufacturers to report production cost and product yield information for all dairy products processed in the same facility or facilities to the Department of Agriculture (USDA) Dairy Product Mandatory Reporting Program. Further, USDA must publish a report containing the information obtained under these new requirements and publish a report every two years thereafter.</p><p>As background, under the Dairy Product Mandatory Reporting Program, USDA must collect certain dairy product sales information from manufacturers and release the data&nbsp;on a weekly basis.</p>","updateDate":"2025-03-07T16:57:12Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Fair Milk Pricing for Farmers Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-18T00:06:09Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-18T00:06:09Z"}
